Per_sollicitar_mus_cal_fer_,           "For futures upgrades you can connect directly to MUS (https://www.miramon.cat/USA/Prod-MUS.htm) and do a simple click on the MMZ files that you want."
Per_connectar_mus_cal_fer_,            "If it is your first time using the program, we recommend that when you start the program for the first time, you setup the favorite collections to have some general useful maps and to see some of the main characteristics of the program as well."
Detectat_registrada_s_Millor_el_teu,   "This program detects a registered version of MiraMon in %s directory.\n\nThis Reader DOES NOT HAVE more functionalities than the last version of MiraMon, but a lot of limitations."
