Nomes_lu_colors_MiraMon_necessita_mes, "Your graphic board configuration only supports %lu colors.\n\nIt is recommended that you run MiraMon in a display mode that supports at least 32768 colors."
_265_prou_pero_millor_mes_Vols_saber_, "Using 256 colors is almost enough, but in some cases you will notice INCORRECT COLORS (although this will not affect the program performance).\n\nDo you want to know how to solve this problem?"
Va_amb_16_colors_pero_millor_256,      "MiraMon requires a VGA graphic board with a minimum of 640x480 pixels and 16 colors.\nAlthough a board with 256 colors is better for working, it is highly recommended to use \"real color\" drivers.\n"
Cal_256_enlloc_de_16_colors,           "The minimum features of the graphic board are the same as the usual VGA (640x480 pixels and 16 colors), although a board with 640x480 pixels and 256 colors is almost essential for MiraMon to work properly."
Tu_pots_canviar_driver_a_color_real,   "You should change/upgrade your graphic board drivers.\nAlthough a board with 640x480 pixels and 256 colors is better for working, it is highly recommended to use \"real color\" drivers.\n"
Tens_256_millor_color_real,            "Although a board with 640x480 pixels and 256 colors is enough for working, it is highly recommended to use \"real color\" drivers."
Pregunta_proveidor_com_tenir_real,     "If needed, ask your computer's dealer, ...maybe you will discover that your board can show \"real color\" images (16.8 millions of simultaneous colors);"
Busca_drivers_per_veure_be_RBG,        "these drivers usually present less problems, you could display in the better way composites of three RGB images (or 24-bits BMP), simultaneous view of different images and vectors with different color palettes, etc.\n"
Instruccions_per_canviar_els_drivers,  "In order to change your graphic board driver configuration, follow these instructions:\n\n* Windows 3.1x:\nOpen the Windows Setup icon in the Main program group. Select \"Options|Change system configuration\""
escollir_32768_mes_I_tambe_en_NT,      "and choose a driver display of 32768 (or more) colors.\n\n* Windows 95/98/ME/NT/2000/XP/2003:\nOpen the Control Panel, double click the Display icon, select Configuration and choose a mode of 32768 (or more) colors."
No_creo_s_MM32_LNK_fesho_a_ma_a_s,     "Cannot create %s. Please, create a shortcut to CMD.EXE in %s directory manually."
Configuracio_MM_usa_menu_s,            "The MiraMon configuration is set to use the \"%s\"."
Versio_registrada_sobre_lector,        "Probably, this is due to you are overwritting a MiraMon registered version on a MiraMon Universal Map Reader."
