No_puc_desinstalar_local_en_aquest_pc, "Uninstall process has to be done using a diferent procedure and in the server."
Useu_inst_mmx_que_toca_per_la_versio,  "Useu el programa d'instal·lació corresponent a la versió disponible (p.ex. inst_mm5.exe per a la versió 5)."
Llicencia_usuari_s_dia_s,              "The process of setting up a licence for user %s bought the %s will take place."
Retiro_llicencia_servidor_No_apaguis,  "This removes a llicence on the MiraMon llicence server and sets up it in your computer. Please do not shut down the computer (neither this application) until it is completed."
Desinstalar_llicencia_No_apaguis,      "The process of uninstalling the licence will take place.\n\nThis remove the licence in your computer and returns it to the MiraMon licence server. Please do not shut down the computer until the end of this process or you will loose the licence."
Preparar_fitxer_s_Anar_servidor_tornar_s,  "A file will be prepared and you have to give it to the MiraMon licence server.\n\n1.- Save this file in a disk or in a USB device (%s).\n2.- Go to a computer with Internet connection and come back with a second file (%s)."
